src/input*.c, src/input.h, src/out.c, src/out.h come from inmarsat-rx (same author, GPL-3.0-or-later).

Independent implementation from the Cospas-Sarsat specifications C/S T.001 (first-generation
beacons) and C/S T.018 (second-generation beacons). dec406 (https://github.com/moricef/dec406,
MIT) was used as a reference: for constants (BCH generators, frame sync words, PRN seeds and
LFSR), test vectors, and as the baseline in comparisons. No dec406 code is compiled into this
program (the receiver). src/mids.c lists ITU Maritime Identification Digits, cross-checked with dec406's table.

third_party/dec406/ is dec406's hex decoder, copied unchanged (MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026
Fabrice Morel; see third_party/dec406/LICENSE and README.md). It builds into a separate program,
dec406_hex, which the observatory runs for each frame's fields and reported position.
